{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A basic kit for a confident start in the world of Aura. Use healing and accelerating potions, gain more experience and trophies, and use your wings to explore locations faster. The perfect choice for beginners to start their adventures confidently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Contains:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Thirum's Nectar</strong> (\u00d775)<br>Instantly restores 100% of health, energy and mana. Cooldown: 30 seconds, unaffected by other items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Mad Bumblebuzz Wings</strong> (\u00d7200)<br>Teleports the player to a random place within the current location. A great tool if you need to explore the location fast or escape from a dangerous situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Swiftness Potion</strong> (\u00d750)<br>Gives +30% to running speed for 10 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Scroll of Experience 100%</strong> (\u00d710)<br>Increases experience gained for killing monsters by 100% for 60 minutes.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3643140?t=1750529088","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3643140?t=1750529088","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643140/271e8f9bbe7affa08294fbbb27c0c67f77923bca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750529088","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643140/271e8f9bbe7affa08294fbbb27c0c67f77923bca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750529088","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A basic kit for a confident start in the world of Aura. Use healing and accelerating potions, gain more experience and trophies, and use your wings to explore locations faster. The perfect choice for beginners to start their adventures confidently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Contains:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Thirum's Nectar</strong> (\u00d775)<br>Instantly restores 100% of health, energy and mana. Cooldown: 30 seconds, unaffected by other items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Mad Bumblebuzz Wings</strong> (\u00d7200)<br>Teleports the player to a random place within the current location. A great tool if you need to explore the location fast or escape from a dangerous situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Swiftness Potion</strong> (\u00d750)<br>Gives +30% to running speed for 10 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong>Scroll of Experience 100%</strong> (\u00d710)<br>Increases experience gained for killing monsters by 100% for 60 minutes.</p>","developers":["BASE"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2962300","name":"Royal Quest Online"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643140/c22f6c85a8f0d81e4933b921b00a72da39f9ef1b/header.jpg?t=1750529088","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Royal Quest Online - Quick start","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"o